<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (AI agents are not a future concept. They are running in production today, managing inboxes, executing code, querying databases, and orchestrating multi-step workflows, all without human intervention at each step. The market is moving fast: frameworks like LangGraph, OpenClaw, and AutoGen have attracted tens of thousands of deployments in weeks. Analysts are calling this the biggest infrastructure shift since cloud computing.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
