318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (Traditional incident response playbooks assume a discrete breach event: a moment when unauthorized access occurred, a system that was compromised, a dataset that was exfiltrated. AI failures do not follow this pattern.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (A model that has been hallucinating on financial analysis for six months is not a breach event. It is a silent operational failure with cumulative downstream consequences. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
320 0 obj
<<
